<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA 28-, 182-, 273-DAY T-BILLS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA 28-, 182-, 273-DAY T-BILLS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-, 182-, 273-day Treasury bills fell, while the yield on 91-day paper rose compared to the previous auctions on August 5, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    Aug 12	     Aug 5</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 4.63 million	   2.85 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 million	   2.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    15.83 pct	  17.17 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.80 pct	  98.70 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.80-99.00 pct  98.70-99.00 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Sep 11, 1997     Sep 4, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 91-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    Aug 12	     Aug 5</p>
<p> Issue volume		   15.00 million	  10.00 million</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 23.67 million	  21.14 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    15.00 million	  10.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    17.58 pct	  16.71 pct</p>
<p> Price			    95.80 pct	  96.00 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  95.80-96.60 pct  96.00-96.50 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Nov 13, 1997     Nov 6, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day paper auction:</p>
<p>				    Aug 12	     Aug 5</p>
<p> Issue volume		   5.00 million lei     4.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 8.69 million	   4.65 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    5.00 million	   4.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    18.63 pct	  18.87 pct</p>
<p> Price			    91.50 pct	  91.40 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  91.50-92.00 pct  91.40-93.00 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Feb 12, 1998     Feb 5, 1998</p>
<p>Full details of the 273-day paper auction:</p>
<p>				    Aug 12	     July 22</p>
<p> Issue volume		   5 00 million lei     7.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 6.67 million	   6.79 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    5.00 million	   6.50 million</p>
<p> Yield			    21.22 pct	  21.23 pct</p>
<p> Price			    86.30 pct	  86.30 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  86.30-88.00 pct  86.30-87.50 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 May 14, 1998     April 23, 1998</p>
